# lockIn

Read `AGENTS.md` before changing this app.

Product name is **lockIn**. The folder is still `proactive/`.

Standalone Next.js app. Do not re-link `@drizznet/*` workspace packages.

Marketing is `/`. The product UI lives under `(app)/` starting at `/dashboard`.

Nothing derived is persisted (session elapsed time is computed). App pages wait
for hydration because day keys depend on the viewer's local calendar.
